      "proposition": "The majority will hold that Heller's protection of arms in common lawful civilian use forecloses categorical bans on AR-15 platform and similar semiautomatic rifles; military resemblance and exceptional dangerousness do not supply an independent historical exception for this commonly possessed class."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "ground-breadth",
      "proposition": "The majority will announce a class-wide protection against categorical possession bans on AR-15 platform and similar semiautomatic rifles, rather than confining relief to these plaintiffs or merely requiring a better evidentiary record."
